<title>NORWAY: Norsk Hydro H1 operating profit by division.</title>
<headline>Norsk Hydro H1 operating profit by division.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Operating profit by division at Norwegian industrial giant Norsk Hydro ASA for the six months to June 30.</p>
<p>				(millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p>  Operating profit	    5,975	vs	5,749</p>
<p>	 Agriculture	    1,399	vs	1,755</p>
<p>	 Oil &amp; gas		3,479	vs	2,945</p>
<p>	 Light metals	   1,057	vs	  990</p>
<p>	 Petrochemicals	   178	vs	   90</p>
<p>	 Others	    minus  138	vs   minus 31</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
